abstract: >-
  A 232K-parameter neural executor with explicit transition memory and
  attention-level process supervision executes arbitrary DFAs with up to 32
  states at 100% trace accuracy, generalizing from training length 50 to
  1000, while 7B Transformers (including reasoning models) achieve zero
  structural accuracy on the same task. We further demonstrate a natural-
  language middleware (LLM parses, executor computes) and an external
  activation-tape enabling audit, replay, checkpointing, and memoization.
  Generalizes to recursive programs and real Python source execution via
  an ast-based compiler with idiom selection.
